"to the mu-plugin and outputting og:locale + og:locale:alternate only. You "
"can deactivate the mu-plugin — LF's built-in Social Share (SEO → Social "
"Share tab) and Open Graph cover the same functionality."
msgstr ""
"Mu-plugin lf-social-share détecté. LF reporte l'ensemble OG de base au mu-"
"plugin et ne sort que og:locale + og:locale:alternate. Vous pouvez "
"désactiver le mu-plugin — LF's Social Share intégré (onglet SEO → Partage "
